$ jailops app new memcached --package memcached --service memcached --port 11211/tcp --category database --dir <dir>/apps
Wrote <dir>/apps/memcached.yaml with 9 line(s) marked TODO, and <dir>/apps/memcached.svg (a placeholder icon).
Next:
  1. Fill in each line marked TODO; 'jailops app validate <dir>/apps/memcached.yaml' lists the ones left.
  2. On a FreeBSD host, copy both files into /usr/local/etc/jailops/apps and run 'jailops app install memcached'.
  3. Send them to the packages repository (main/jailops-apps/apps/): docs/apps.md, "Write your own app".

